{"title":"2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In “The Sun Game”, two players take turns placing discs numbered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the circles on the board. Each number can only be used once. The object of the game is to be the first to place a disc so that the sum of the 3 numbers along a line through the centre circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3a (page does not exist)\">2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3b&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3b (page does not exist)\">2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_3c&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3c (page does not exist)\">2004 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 3c</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017203800\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 34/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 514/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.665      1 Template:Image_needed\n100.00%    5.665      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36921:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017203800 and revision id 285718. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}